                                "sense_id": "2f174cf5-a978-3eb0-bab8-1bc47d605891",
                                "text": "It has been my extreme pleasure to play with these fellow miscreants over the years, particularly in live-action role-playing versions of Lovecraftian adventures we enacted during our college years, and then again when they built sets and miniatures for their first film, […]"
                            }
                        ]
